---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact" description="Get in touch with Network Academy.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Get in touch</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-neutral mt-6 dark:prose-invert">
      <p>Have questions, feedback or want to discuss a partnership? We'd like to hear from you.</p>

      <h2>Email</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:bdilidili1@gmail.com">bdilidili1@gmail.com</a></p>
      <p>For account or privacy concerns, please mention your email address or account ID so we can locate your records quickly.</p>

      <h2>Mailing address</h2>
      <p>
        Network Academy<br />
        PKT (Pocket)<br />
        215 Tres Cruses<br />
        Tanza, Cavite<br />
        Philippines
      </p>

      <h2>What to contact us about</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Content questions or errors</strong> - found a mistake in a lesson or lab? Let us know.</li>
        <li><strong>Account or privacy</strong> - need to update your account or delete your data? See our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for details or email us.</li>
        <li><strong>Licensing or affiliates</strong> - interested in partnerships, affiliate programs or licensing?</li>
        <li><strong>Sponsorships</strong> - want to sponsor Network Academy? See our <a href="/sponsors">Sponsors page</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>General feedback</strong> - suggestions to improve the site.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Response time</h2>
      <p>We aim to respond to all inquiries within one week. For urgent account issues or privacy requests, please mark your subject line with [URGENT].</p>

      <h2>Links</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/about">About Network Academy</a></li>
        <li><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></li>
        <li><a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a></li>
        <li><a href="/disclaimer">Content Disclaimer</a></li>
        <li><a href="/sources">Sources and Citations</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
